  "description": "The Classic Plus is the premier low maintenance, hassle free, belt-drive bicycle. It has an award-winning comfortable ride, rust-free & ultralight frame, and three-speed versatility for recreational riding plus upgraded components for more frequent riders and light commuters including:\n\nGrease and rust-free Gates Carbon Drive Belt designed to ride longer than a traditional chain\nFront hand and rear hand brake\nEnhanced wheels and pedals for best in class durability\nLarger array of sizing\n\nNew for 2022!\n\nThe Classic Plus will now arrive with a freewheel. This model includes front and rear V-Brakes, allowing you to pedal backwards without engaging a brake. (New pictures coming soon!)\n\nWeighing only as much as a few bags of groceries at just 25 lbs! The Classic Plus is light weight and easy to ride. The belt drive keeps your commute clean, without worry of grease and grime. An upright and comfortable riding style makes weekend cruises a breeze. The Classic Plus is ready to go with a kickstand, water bottle cage, puncture resistant tires, and air pump all included.\nClick to See Why Gizmodo Recommends the Classic Plus & why Men's Journal loves \"its simple construction, hip look, and light weight.\"\nPSA: Most bicycles are selling out before they are produced. If you are looking to purchase a bicycle, we encourage you to back-order early. Our individual product pages reflect the most accurate back-order and ship dates for each model. These dates are updated in real-time for future purchases, and we generally sell out of most models before the date posted. Secure your ship date with a back-order, which can be cancelled at any time for a full refund before your bicycle ships.\nBells are a great functional accessory to be heard on your cruise! Our customers love our Rust Free Brass Bell.",
